+
+    Trigger Warm Reset
+
+    ${boot} =   Read Attribute  /org/openbmc/settings/host0    boot_policy
+    Should Be Equal    ${boot}    PERMANENT
+
+    ${flag} =   Read Attribute  /org/openbmc/settings/host0    boot_flags
